§2  MAIN TERMINALS — 6 SOVEREIGN COMMAND DOMAINS
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  TERMINAL 01 — SOVEREIGN COMMAND (medina@sovereign)

  The root terminal. All other terminals report here. Every system-wide
  operation — organism lifecycle events, health checks, sovereign overrides,
  emergency shutdowns — flows through this terminal. It is the nucleus.

  AI System:  IMPERATOR AGI — Sovereign Command Intelligence
  Latin:      Imperator Intelligentiae Souverainae
  Class:      COMMAND.ROOT
  Authority:  ABSOLUTE — no override except FOUNDER veto

  Processes:
    [■■■■■■■■■■]  organism-lifecycle ........... MANAGING
    [■■■■■■■■■■]  system-health ................ MONITORING
    [■■■■■■■■■■]  sovereign-overrides .......... ARMED
    [■■■■■■■■■■]  terminal-coordination ........ ROUTING
    [■■■■■■■■■■]  heartbeat-φ .................. BEATING @ 618ms

  Packages: organism-kernel, living-document, organism-contracts, sandbox-layer

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

