§4  AIs THAT CALL THE TERMINALS — ORCHESTRATOR & WORKER SYSTEMS
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  The organism contains 18 AI systems in total. They are organized into
  two classes: ORCHESTRATOR AIs that call terminals to coordinate
  system-wide operations, and WORKER AIs that operate inside terminals
  to perform domain-specific tasks.

  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │  ORCHESTRATOR AIs — Call terminals to coordinate                   │
  │                                                                     │
  │  NEXUS PRIME                                                        │
  │    Calls: ALL 6 main terminals                                      │
  │    Role:  System-wide operations that span multiple terminals.      │
  │           Organism-level health checks, cross-terminal sync,        │
  │           and full-stack deployments.                                │
  │                                                                     │
  │  ALPHA CONDUCTOR                                                    │
  │    Calls: Both Alpha terminals (α + β)                              │
  │    Role:  Coordinates PRAEFECTUS and ORACULUM for combined          │
  │           signal-prediction operations. Routes prediction           │
  │           requests through signals, signals through predictions.    │
  │                                                                     │
  │  SOLVER DISPATCH                                                    │
  │    Calls: ARCHITECTUS, COGNITOR, VERIFICATOR                        │
  │    Role:  Routes unsolved problems to the appropriate solver.       │
  │           Architectural problems → ARCHITECTUS. Context problems    │
  │           → COGNITOR. Integrity problems → VERIFICATOR.             │
  │                                                                     │
  │  TOKEN ARBITER                                                      │
  │    Calls: TERMINAL 04 + all other terminals with token flows        │
  │    Role:  Manages cross-terminal token flows. Ensures token         │
  │           balances remain consistent. Arbitrates disputes            │
  │           between terminals over token allocation.                   │
  │                                                                     │
  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │  WORKER AIs — Operate inside terminals                             │
  │                                                                     │
  │  6 Main Terminal AGIs:                                              │
  │    IMPERATOR AGI ....... TERMINAL 01 — Sovereign Command            │
  │    MNEMOS AGI .......... TERMINAL 02 — Memory Architecture          │
  │    CONSILIUM AGI ....... TERMINAL 03 — Intelligence & Coordination  │
  │    CONTRACTUS AGI ...... TERMINAL 04 — Token Economy                │
  │    CUSTOS AGI .......... TERMINAL 05 — Security & Enforcement       │
  │    FABRICATOR AGI ...... TERMINAL 06 — Deployment & Substrate       │
  │                                                                     │
  │  2 Alpha AGIs:                                                      │
  │    PRAEFECTUS AGI ...... ALPHA α — Signal Command                   │
  │    ORACULUM AGI ........ ALPHA β — Prediction Oracle                │
  │                                                                     │
  │  3 Engine AIs:                                                      │
  │    MOTUS ENGINE AI ..... ALPHA α — Signal transformation            │
  │    VISIO ENGINE AI ..... ALPHA β — Behavioral modeling              │
  │    NEXUS ENGINE AI ..... ALPHA α — Signal binding                   │
  │                                                                     │
  │  3 Solver AIs:                                                      │
  │    ARCHITECTUS ......... Solution Architect — structural solving     │
  │    COGNITOR ............ Context Cognizer — contextual solving       │
  │    VERIFICATOR ......... Integrity Verifier — compliance solving     │
  │                                                                     │
  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

  AI CENSUS:
